Sugimoto?!

00:12:00.261 --> 00:12:04.599
I'm okay! Let him go, Ritsu.

00:12:04.849 --> 00:12:05.767
You sure?

00:12:06.017 --> 00:12:08.061
They seem like a bad crowd.

00:12:09.062 --> 00:12:11.606
Dude, what's wrong with you, Sugimoto?

00:12:18.071 --> 00:12:20.240
Did you need something from our club member?

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:21.241
Huh?

00:12:21.491 --> 00:12:23.326
Wh-Who the hell are you guys?!

00:12:23.576 --> 00:12:25.620
Who said you could surround
me like that, huh?

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.538
Bring it on, you bastards!

00:12:27.789 --> 00:12:29.082
I'll kick yer asses!

00:12:29.332 --> 00:12:32.794
Hey, stop squishing me, damn it!

00:12:33.044 --> 00:12:35.338
Hey, I can't get out!

00:12:35.588 --> 00:12:38.007
Hey!

00:12:38.258 --> 00:12:41.261
Um, I'm fine, so please don't fight.

00:12:41.511 --> 00:12:43.263
Fair enough.

00:12:43.513 --> 00:12:44.889
Sugimoto!

00:12:45.139 --> 00:12:47.850
You'll regret this, you jerks!

00:12:48.101 --> 00:12:49.769
You sure you're all right?

00:12:50.019 --> 00:12:51.521
Yes. Thank you.

00:12:51.771 --> 00:12:54.148
You need to know when to
fight back, Kageyama.

00:12:54.399 --> 00:12:56.567
Or they're just going to try
to bully you even more.

00:12:56.818 --> 00:12:58.778
I can't think of a good way to.

00:12:59.028 --> 00:13:01.990
Kick their asses with your
shadow leader powers.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:06.119
You don't have to waste your powers
on guys like them, Nii-san.

00:13:06.369 --> 00:13:08.538
If they show up again, I'll get rid of them.

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:13.960
Raking bad guys over the coals is
what's good for them and society.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:16.296
Make sure you kick their
asses on your own next time.

00:13:16.546 --> 00:13:18.798
You've got the power to do it.

00:13:21.009 --> 00:13:23.177
"Spirits and Such Consultation Office"

00:13:24.178 --> 00:13:26.097
What? You ended up with a spirit photo?

00:13:26.347 --> 00:13:29.976
Yes... So we wanted to
ask for your help again.

00:13:30.226 --> 00:13:33.896
Just throw some salt around.
I don't do volunteer work.

00:13:34.147 --> 00:13:37.275
We're really sorry! We'll pay!

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:39.944
So what's the job?

00:13:40.194 --> 00:13:42.905
We want to go back to that haunted place

00:13:43.156 --> 00:13:46.451
and have you make the ghost
in this picture disappear!

00:13:49.078 --> 00:13:52.248
I mean, I can exorcise that
photograph if you'd like.

00:13:52.498 --> 00:13:54.083
We don't even need to go back to the place.

00:13:54.334 --> 00:13:58.338
No way! It's creepy enough
knowing that thing exists!

00:13:58.588 --> 00:14:00.006
Please get rid of it!

00:14:00.256 --> 00:14:02.550
So an exorcism request. Very well.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.177
Let me explain the various options--

00:14:04.427 --> 00:14:06.387
We'll take the most expensive one!

00:14:09.849 --> 00:14:11.351
Looks like you got dragged out again.

00:14:11.601 --> 00:14:13.311
And your Sunday got ruined yesterday.

00:14:13.561 --> 00:14:15.438
You can get pissed off about this, y'know?

00:14:25.323 --> 00:14:27.700
Please wrap this up as soon as possible.

00:14:47.512 --> 00:14:48.679
There're three of them.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:51.391
They don't seem to be evil spirits, though.

00:14:51.641 --> 00:14:54.727
We'll just have to take care of them.
They're scaring our clients.

00:14:54.977 --> 00:14:56.396
Go ahead and exorcise them.

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.148
Please don't.

00:15:05.196 --> 00:15:08.116
The three of us are family.

00:15:08.366 --> 00:15:12.286
We died in an accident and
lost our chance at a good life.

00:15:12.537 --> 00:15:18.000
But now that we're ghosts,
we've been living here peacefully.

00:15:18.251 --> 00:15:20.294
We haven't done anything wrong.

00:15:20.545 --> 00:15:24.590
I just want... to stay with my
family a little bit longer.

00:15:25.842 --> 00:15:30.471
As soon as this desire is fulfilled,
we will disappear naturally.

00:15:30.721 --> 00:15:34.100
So I beg of you... Please, let us be.

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:36.561
Did you hear that, Master?

00:15:36.811 --> 00:15:38.438
Nope, not a thing.

00:15:38.688 --> 00:15:40.773
Their aura must be too weak.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:46.279
Th-There's no reason to exorcise them.

00:15:46.529 --> 00:15:48.281
They said that they
wouldn't do anything bad.

00:15:48.531 --> 00:15:49.407
They're a family.

00:15:49.657 --> 00:15:50.533
Hello?!

00:15:50.783 --> 00:15:52.994
We called you here because we
need you to exorcise them!

00:15:53.244 --> 00:15:55.329
It's way too creepy knowing they're here!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.790
Who cares if they do anything bad or not?

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.709
Not to mention, we said we'd pay you!

00:15:59.959 --> 00:16:01.627
Hurry up and exorcise them already!

00:16:01.878 --> 00:16:03.421
I'm getting goosebumps just standing here!

00:16:03.671 --> 00:16:05.798
It's so creepy,
I feel like I'm going to throw up.

00:16:06.048 --> 00:16:07.800
What's the matter, Mob?

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:11.179
You've gotten rid of plenty
of evil spirits before.

00:16:11.429 --> 00:16:14.765
These people just want to live in peace.

00:16:15.016 --> 00:16:18.895
I can't... I don't want to destroy that.

00:16:19.145 --> 00:16:24.192
Just hurry up and do it already!
No one cares how you feel!

00:16:24.442 --> 00:16:29.197
Sir, we asked for your help
because we really needed it.

00:16:30.239 --> 00:16:33.493
Our customers always take top priority.

00:16:35.495 --> 00:16:39.916
However, if spirits deserve
as much respect as the living,

00:16:40.166 --> 00:16:44.337
and the three here are truly
just a family living peacefully...

00:16:44.587 --> 00:16:51.761
Then I can't make Mob do something as
heinous as barging in and dispatching them.

00:16:52.011 --> 00:16:54.889
But our clients' fear is real, too.

00:16:55.139 --> 00:16:56.057
What should I do?

00:16:56.307 --> 00:17:00.186
As a professional, can I really put
the ghosts above the clients?

00:17:00.436 --> 00:17:01.562
Hey, man of the house.

00:17:01.812 --> 00:17:05.900
I see you've got plenty of
pent-up spiritual power.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:07.193
Dimple?

00:17:07.443 --> 00:17:11.155
You gained that strength to
protect your family, right?

00:17:11.405 --> 00:17:13.074
In that case...

00:17:13.324 --> 00:17:16.452
Why not kill those three right now?

00:17:16.702 --> 00:17:21.165
They won't have to exorcise you
if the clients are dead.

00:17:24.835 --> 00:17:27.129
You want to live peacefully
with your family, right?

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:30.258
Go on. What other choice do you have?

00:17:44.897 --> 00:17:45.773
Darling...

00:17:46.023 --> 00:17:47.942
Daddy...

00:17:48.192 --> 00:17:51.988
I beg of you... Please let us be.

00:17:52.238 --> 00:17:54.740
I cannot do something so horrific,

00:17:54.991 --> 00:17:56.701
especially in front of my child...

00:17:56.951 --> 00:17:59.579
I see. Well, what're you gonna do, then?

00:17:59.829 --> 00:18:02.707
But we have nowhere left to run.

00:18:02.957 --> 00:18:07.253
If you must go through with it,
we'll just have to accept it.

00:18:07.503 --> 00:18:09.005
But, please...

00:18:09.255 --> 00:18:12.800
Please, I ask that you
let us all go together,

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:15.595
wherever it may be.

00:18:15.845 --> 00:18:19.056
Mob, are the spirits still saying something?

00:18:24.437 --> 00:18:27.189
--You...
--Hey... So what's going on?

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:28.733
A moment, please.

00:18:28.983 --> 00:18:29.859
What's wrong, Mob?

00:18:30.109 --> 00:18:32.737
He's so against exorcising them
that it's making him tremble.

00:18:32.987 --> 00:18:34.363
That much, huh?

00:18:34.614 --> 00:18:37.366
Okay, got it. Let's skip the exorcism.

00:18:37.617 --> 00:18:40.036
It's not like I'm ordering you.

00:18:40.286 --> 00:18:42.830
It's okay to listen to your feelings.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.083
Yup. You don't have to
take this so seriously.

00:18:46.334 --> 00:18:48.919
You're plenty strong, Shigeo.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:51.547
I don't think you understand...

00:18:56.761 --> 00:19:00.556
This must be something
that only I understand...

00:19:00.806 --> 00:19:04.185
I mean, there's no way I can
go off my feelings alone.

00:19:04.435 --> 00:19:05.978
I can't take this lightly.

00:19:06.228 --> 00:19:10.608
If I truly decide to protect this family,

00:19:10.858 --> 00:19:14.862
that'll mean the clients will
have to get hurt instead.

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.115
How long is this gonna take, damn it?!

00:19:18.366 --> 00:19:20.242
Who cares what the brat--

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:25.122
Yo, what the hell is this? Salt?!

00:19:25.873 --> 00:19:27.625
This concludes the exorcism.

00:19:27.875 --> 00:19:30.378
What? Wait, seriously?

00:19:30.628 --> 00:19:31.671
That was it?

00:19:31.921 --> 00:19:33.297
We're done here.

00:19:33.547 --> 00:19:35.508
Uh, okay.

00:19:37.093 --> 00:19:39.637
Reigen? What's the matter with you now?

00:19:39.887 --> 00:19:43.974
So that's what's going on here...
Why didn't I realize it sooner?

00:19:46.102 --> 00:19:49.105
He can do so much more
than an average person.

00:19:49.355 --> 00:19:52.066
The world he can see
is far bigger than ours.

00:19:52.316 --> 00:19:55.986
Curses and spirits are
a part of Mob's daily life.

00:19:57.071 --> 00:20:02.159
Both the human and the inhuman
are equally close to him.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.703
Damn it!

00:20:03.953 --> 00:20:08.207
It's all because I took too many jobs,
got complacent, and half-assed things.

00:20:11.627 --> 00:20:12.753
Let's head back.

00:20:14.964 --> 00:20:17.133
Want some soba?

00:20:17.383 --> 00:20:18.592
Okay.

