00:20:52.293 --> 00:20:53.753
Why are you trembling now?

00:20:55.129 --> 00:20:58.257
Oh, you're yawning.
Man, you two are like night and day.

00:20:58.507 --> 00:21:01.552
Hey, you've got something on your back.

00:21:01.802 --> 00:21:02.636
What?

00:21:02.887 --> 00:21:05.514
Yeah, someone definitely cursed you.

00:21:05.765 --> 00:21:07.308
What'll happen to me if I leave it alone?

00:21:07.558 --> 00:21:11.353
You might slip on a banana peel at least.

00:21:11.604 --> 00:21:13.898
That'd be enough to do me in
if I was on some stairs.

00:21:14.148 --> 00:21:17.610
--Get rid of it for me.
--Your attitude sucks, so nope.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:20.613
Please, I can't ask Mob to do this for me.

00:21:20.863 --> 00:21:24.658
I bet the guy from yesterday hired
someone who could actually use curses.

00:21:24.909 --> 00:21:26.994
All right, fine.

00:21:29.038 --> 00:21:31.916
He might be able to see
something more terrifying

00:21:32.166 --> 00:21:35.836
